         "fourteen_days": "The figure above shows the prognosis for the 14-day interval between 02/26/2025 e 03/11/2025, forecast of positive precipitation anomalies (blue) over almost all the basins, in the north, west and southwest of the monitored area. Precipitation deficit forecast (orange) in the southeast, over the Iriri, Juruena, Tapajós and Xingu river basins. Rainfall close to climatology (white) over the main course of the Amazon River in Peruvian territory, Abacaxis, Aripuanã, Coari, Javari, Ji-Paraná, Teles Pires and basins on the left bank of the Amazon River in the northeast of the state of Pará."
